  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Fees that may be applied to customers for utilizing Doorstep Banking services, which can vary based on different factors or pre-agreed schedules.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-574eef8b2a231a2171cb4eadad4c29e5-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Door-Step Banking for Senior Citizens and Differently-Abled.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787740931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
