  <data key="d0">Force Majeure</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Circumstances beyond the control of the bank that may prevent the timely delivery of services, including natural disasters and civil disturbances.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-574eef8b2a231a2171cb4eadad4c29e5-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Door-Step Banking for Senior Citizens and Differently-Abled.pdf</data>
