  <data key="d0">Bank Policies</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The policies that may change the savings limits for banking services over time, providing variability to the limits presented.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-574eef8b2a231a2171cb4eadad4c29e5-mm-table-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Door-Step Banking for Senior Citizens and Differently-Abled.pdf</data>
