  <data key="d0">Succession Certificate</data>
  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">A legal document that grants authority to an individual to inherit the assets of a deceased person, usable for settling claims.&lt;SEP&gt;Succession Certificate is a legal document certifying the identity of legal heirs to a deceased person's estate.</data>
