  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A secure storage compartment, typically in a bank, used for storing valuables.&lt;SEP&gt;A storage unit mentioned in the protocols that requires specific access instructions in case of the owner's death.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2d2b1e01babacd5427ea9228ee35f7f9-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2d2b1e01babacd5427ea9228ee35f7f9-mm-table-006</data>
