<node id="A">
  <data key="d0">A</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A is a person involved in various scenarios related to access to lockers upon death.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual mentioned as a depositor in the provided context.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who may nominate another person for locker access, potentially involved in single or joint nominations.&lt;SEP&gt;One of the individuals named in the protocols who may have a locker accessed by legal heirs or mandated individuals upon their death.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2d2b1e01babacd5427ea9228ee35f7f9-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2d2b1e01babacd5427ea9228ee35f7f9-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2d2b1e01babacd5427ea9228ee35f7f9-mm-table-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2d2b1e01babacd5427ea9228ee35f7f9-mm-table-006</data>
