  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="B">
  <data key="d0">B</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">B is a person who has a joint locker arrangement with A and is involved in the access processes outlined upon the death of either individual.&lt;SEP&gt;Another individual mentioned as a depositor alongside person A.&lt;SEP&gt;Another individual who is involved in joint nominations for locker access alongside person A.&lt;SEP&gt;The other individual named in the protocols who, along with A, affects the access rights to the locker based on their death scenario.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2d2b1e01babacd5427ea9228ee35f7f9-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2d2b1e01babacd5427ea9228ee35f7f9-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2d2b1e01babacd5427ea9228ee35f7f9-mm-table-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2d2b1e01babacd5427ea9228ee35f7f9-mm-table-006</data>
