<node id="tb-2d2b1e01babacd5427ea9228ee35f7f9-0001">
  <data key="d0">tb-2d2b1e01babacd5427ea9228ee35f7f9-0001</data>
  <data key="d1">table</data>
  <data key="d2">[Table Name]authorized_officials_for_claims_settlement

This table identifies key officials authorized to approve claims for the settlement of accounts, deposits, and safe deposit lockers of deceased depositors who did not have nominations registered. The table consists of two columns: 'Name' and 'Designation', providing the names of six officials along with their respective roles in the organization. The officials listed are Mr. Surinderpal Singh, Mr. Gautam Chawla, Mr. Ponnuraj P., Ms. Uma Sundar, and Ms. Kawalpreet Suri. The designations range from National Sales Head- Branch Banking to various senior vice president (SVP) and vice president (VP) roles related to banking operations, products, distribution, and channels. This delineation of roles highlights the structure of authority within the bank for claims settlements. The data does not include any totals or calculated values, and the table does not indicate any merged cells or complex structures. It serves a specific purpose in the context of a policy document regarding customer service and claims processing for deceased depositors.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2d2b1e01babacd5427ea9228ee35f7f9-mm-table-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Rules of Nomination &amp; Settlement of Claim 1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787741494</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
