<edge source="A" target="B">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A and B have a joint locker arrangement where upon the death of either, the survivor has access to the locker.&lt;SEP&gt;In a joint account with operational instructions of 'Either or Survivor', B will receive the outstanding amount upon A's death.</data>
  <data key="d9">Joint Account,Survivor,death,joint access</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-2d2b1e01babacd5427ea9228ee35f7f9-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2d2b1e01babacd5427ea9228ee35f7f9-chunk-007</data>
